    "version": "0.2.0",
    "docs": [
      "Short-lived tokens about a story concerning a public company, which expire into that company's tokenized stock.",
      "Buys are priced on a pump.fun-shaped curve denominated in the stock; the stock paid in sits in a vault the creator can never touch.",
      "At expiry the curve freezes and every token is paid its share of the vault, by the holder or by anyone on their behalf.",
      "v0.2: the protocol takes 0.5% of every buy and 1% of the vault at expiry, paid in the stock into the treasury's token account (the Squads vault 3RgUivJM3F7jfN5mT5Hop6i71LPLU8JEi7cG3b9Fhm8S)."
    ],
